  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Crosslink Coastal Pollution with Climate Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Capacity to Crosslink Coastal Pollution with Climate Change - BC5 is a strategic north-south-south university collaboration aimed at building knowledge on sustainable management of marine coastal ecosystems and resources, strengthening and improving existing regional coastal research. BC5 will address the gap between research needs and practice, education, and the management of the coastal resources.</narrative>
  </description>
